OL,3,GNEWSA'I started making wooden reindeer
OL,4,Aaged 12, now I have my own business'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Christmas market season approaches,
OL,7,Fmakers up and down the country will be
OL,8,Fpreparing their wares - but not many
OL,9,Fwill be as young as Charlie Line, who
OL,10,Fstarted his business when he was just
OL,11,F12 years old.
OL,13,FCharlie, now 24, was inspired to start
OL,14,Fmaking gifts out of reclaimed wood
OL,15,Fafter he admired a cute - but
OL,16,Foverpriced - wooden reindeer at a
OL,17,Fgarden centre as a child.
OL,19,F"They're quite popular now, but at the
OL,20,Ftime I thought it was really cool. I
OL,21,Fturned the tag around and it was #50. I
OL,22,Fthought I can make that, definitely.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
